        description: Some("Bay: industrial blue-gray steel, plain but for faint grime in patches a few meters across: no panels, which muddied the forms. Unlit: a slab bay's hold is lit by the lamps the hull material draws in it. One tile is 64 m of hull and must repeat: integer frequencies, and noise with period == frequency. Output color is albedo; the layer named lights is the lit share of each texel. See em_render::hull_material."),
